@startuml 47-token-lifecycle
' One token's journey through the kernel microstep loop (runtime.rs:
' run_until_blocked -> enter_node / route_token -> apply_effect_observation).
title Token lifecycle in the kernel microstep loop (runtime.rs)
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #CDEACC
  BorderColor #5B9E5B
  ArrowColor #294C60
}
skinparam ArrowColor #294C60

[*] --> Queued : new token\n(entry · fan-out · resume)

state Queued : in envelope.queue,\nawaiting a microstep
state Entering : phase = Enter\n(enter_node)
state Joining #FFF0C7
state Joining : absorbed into a JoinState;\nawaits its correlation epoch
state EffectPending : in pending_effects;\nkernel yields Effects(..)
state GuardPending : outgoing edge needs\na pure guard observation
state Suspended #FFF0C7
state Suspended : in pending_waits;\nkernel yields Suspended(..)
state Routing : phase = Route\n(route_token)
state Retired : value collected;\ntoken leaves the loop

Queued --> Entering : pop_front
Entering --> Joining : join target,\nquorum not yet met
Joining --> Routing : join fires\n(merged token, joined = true)
Entering --> EffectPending : activity node\n(schedule_effect)
Entering --> GuardPending : guarded route
Entering --> Suspended : wait node
Entering --> Routing : pass-through node

EffectPending --> Routing : observation completed
EffectPending --> Suspended : failed & retryable\n(SuspensionKind::Retry, backoff)
Suspended --> Queued : resume\n(TimerFired · Approve/Reject ·\nSignal · Event · retry due)
GuardPending --> Routing : guard observed

Routing --> Queued : route to next node(s)\n(fan-out mints new tokens)
Routing --> Retired : output / terminal node
Retired --> [*]

note right of Suspended #FFF0C7
  SuspensionKind ∈ { Timer, Approval, Signal,
  Event, Retry, DurableYield }. Each carries a
  due_at and/or a signal name; a durable checkpoint
  persists the wait so recovery can resume it.
end note

note bottom of Retired #FFF0C7
  The run completes when queue, pending_effects,
  pending_guards, and pending_waits are all empty
  (KernelOutcome::Completed); the step budget is
  <latex>10^6</latex> microsteps (INV-K14).
end note

@enduml
